units metal
atom_style atomic
dimension 3
boundary p p s
newton on

lattice bcc 3.3
region box block 0 20 0 20 0 64.545454545 units lattice
create_box 1 box
region target block 0 20 0 20 0 40 units lattice
create_atoms 1 region target
region projectile block 0 20 0 20 44.545454545 64.545454545 units lattice
create_atoms 1 region projectile
group target region target
group projectile region projectile

pair_style eam/alloy
pair_coeff * * ../../../potentials/prompt1.potential Nb

neighbor 2.0 bin
neigh_modify delay 0 every 1 check yes

timestep 0.001
thermo 1000
thermo_style custom step temp pe ke etotal press

velocity all create 300.0 4928459 mom yes rot yes dist gaussian
fix nvt all nvt temp 300.0 300.0 0.1
run 100000
unfix nvt

velocity projectile set 0.0 0.0 -20.0 sum yes

fix nve all nve
run 200000